# Artificial Evolution changes the text of Bot2's Llanowar Elves, Elf to Goblin (CR 612.1): its type line says Goblin
# Druid, its name is still Llanowar Elves (CR 612.2), and the change lasts indefinitely, past the turn's end. Any
# creature type may be replaced; the new one can't be Wall.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Artificial Evolution
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Artificial Evolution.Cast(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Elf)
! Bot1.Modes(Wall)
Bot1.Modes(Goblin)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Subtypes = Druid; Goblin
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Bot1.Graveyard = Artificial Evolution
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Subtypes = Druid; Goblin
